--- log ---
2026-10-31T21:27Z Minh Ha-Duong created

--- body ---

## Context

Ticket 0042 (PR #67) made `enrich_hal.py` and `enrich_openalex.py` skip
`publicationTitle` outside `journalArticle`, through `src/zotero_fields.py`.
The raid found that `enrich_crossref.py` has the same naive mapping: its
`diff_fields` (`("journal", "publicationTitle")`, ~line 160) never reads
`itemType`. Ticket 0042 assumed a fix was already there; there is none. Zotero
rejects the field with HTTP 400 on `bookSection`, `conferencePaper`, `thesis`
and `report`.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `enrich_crossref.diff_fields` proposes `publicationTitle` only when
      `zotero_fields.allows_publication_title(itemType)` is true
- [ ] Tests: `bookSection` (and other non-journal types) get no
      `publicationTitle`; `journalArticle` still does
